      "doi": "10.1038/s41598-026-76850-w",
      "title": "Performance analysis of dual-IRS-assisted NOMA for underwater visible light communication in turbulent channels",
      "authors": [
        "S Prathibha Praharsha",
        "Mahesh Miriyala",
        "Goutham Veerapu",
